# A decorator, whose φ is an object with data.
#
#   ⟦ foo ↦ ⟦ φ ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧ ⟧ ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.169.

F c0 foo
F c1 φ
F c2
Δ c2 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c1 φ c2
P c0 foo c1
